Package: asus-power-manager
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Rezky P. Budihartono <rezky.codes@gmail.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, upower, udev, systemd
Recommends: hdparm, tuned
Description: Power & Battery Manager for ASUS & Linux Laptops
 Modern GTK4/Libadwaita power management and battery health control utility.
 Supports battery charge limits (80% health care), instant powersave/performance
 switching, clamshell server mode, and hardware stability hardening.
